  Slug: courageous-tanuki
  DisplayName: Courageous Tanuki
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/heritage.svg
  Description: Your heart beats with the courage of those who came before you, giving
    you the kind of bravery only a tanuki can demonstrate. Whenever you gain the
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fleeing] condition, you also gain a
    +10-foot circumstance bonus to your Speeds that lasts as long as you're fleeing.
    When you have the fleeing condition, instead of having to spend all your actions
    trying to escape, you can act normally for one action but must still spend the
    remainder of your actions fleeing. You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Tactical
    Retreat] ability.
